{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17322860","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17322860","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1732286001:1":{"text":"もちろん、オーガスタ家に決まっている！我らオーガスタこそ、ブライト王国の真の主なのだからな！","source_cn":"当然是给我们奥古斯塔家族！毕竟奥古斯塔才是耀光帝国真正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA38F8C64C911C3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732286002:1":{"text":"もし彼女にその気があるなら、まずはオーガスタ家を中心とした連合議会を速やかに設けるべきだ！","source_cn":"如果她真有心放权，那么首先她应该尽快设立以奥古斯塔家族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AFECA4BFB8B1795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732286003:1":{"text":"これ以上、彼女の独裁を許してはいけない！","source_cn":"整个赛凡纳不能再是她一个人说了算！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE07A7AF23B173EEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族贾斯汀":{"text":"貴族のジャスティン","source":"贵族贾斯汀","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}